  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HS Human Resources</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&#xE4;lsosystem och H&#xE4;lsopersonal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anst&#xE4;lla Anna-Clara Kandimaa som kunsult, med m&#xE5;l att presentera en kort rapport vilken identifera, kort,de internationaella coh nationella trenderna i relation till h&#xE4;lsopersonal; och att klarg&#xF6;ra inneb&#xF6;rden av h&#xE4;lsopersonal som ett av byggstenarna i ett h&#xE4;lsosystem.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hire Anna-Carin Kandimaa as a consultant, with the aim to deliver a short report outlining in brief the trends nationally and internationally and country strategies on human resources; and to clarify the meaning of human resources as one of the building blocks in health systems.</narrative>
  </description>
